542
00:47:26.214 --> 00:47:27.612
stop loving me.

543
00:47:31.209 --> 00:47:33.566
And how should I be the first to seek a meeting with him?

544
00:48:49.091 --> 00:48:51.768
Thank you, Sung Jae, for staying alive.

545
00:48:53.566 --> 00:48:55.245
I'm glad you're alive.

546
00:48:56.004 --> 00:48:57.602
I'm very glad.

547
00:48:59.401 --> 00:49:01.279
This is true.

548
00:49:01.998 --> 00:49:04.955
THE SKIN SHOULD TOO REST
I'm truly happy.

549
00:49:13.187 --> 00:49:14.187
Salt.

550
00:49:14.705 --> 00:49:16.943
I really like you.

551
00:49:19.101 --> 00:49:20.260
But I miss you.

552
00:49:32.647 --> 00:49:35.524
Look into the camera. Smile!
Try this!

553
00:49:53.666 --> 00:49:56.743
Today throughout the country it is expected
sunny weather.

554
00:49:56.823 --> 00:50:00.659
Forecasters promise the same temperature
as in the last couple of days.

555
00:50:00.739 --> 00:50:04.615
Due to a long absence of rain
there is a threat of forest fires.

556
00:50:04.695 --> 00:50:06.973
In case of strong wind,
a little spark can...

557
00:50:07.053 --> 00:50:10.729
GANBUKKU DISTRICT POLICE STATION
... catch fire and cause a fire.

558
00:50:10.809 --> 00:50:12.767
Be careful when using

559
00:50:12.847 --> 00:50:15.365
- home heating appliances.
- What is this?

560
00:50:24.715 --> 00:50:25.715
Hello?

561
00:50:27.752 --> 00:50:30.070
Yes. It's me.

562
00:50:31.349 --> 00:50:32.349
What?

563
00:50:33.107 --> 00:50:34.306
Where to go?

564
00:50:35.065 --> 00:50:39.101
I undertake not to approach the place
residence of the victim

565
00:50:39.181 --> 00:50:43.776
and to the victim himself, Ryu Sung Jae
closer than 100 meters.

566
00:50:44.016 --> 00:50:46.134
In case of violation of the order...

567
00:50:48.731 --> 00:50:50.809
I told you, it wasn't me!

568
00:50:50.889 --> 00:50:52.807
We would sit quietly.

569
00:50:52.887 --> 00:50:57.123
They didn't even bother to apologize
They also pushed him into the fountain.

570
00:50:58.362 --> 00:50:59.362
What?

571
00:51:03.077 --> 00:51:04.077
God!

572
00:51:06.953 --> 00:51:08.591
Was it Sung Jae?

573
00:51:10.030 --> 00:51:11.429
What is it?

574
00:51:11.788 --> 00:51:14.146
Where were my eyes?

575
00:51:14.226 --> 00:51:18.541
He was going to write a statement
this is your last chance.

576
00:51:18.621 --> 00:51:20.699
Sign this piece of paper already.

577
00:51:20.899 --> 00:51:21.899
Fine.

578
00:51:25.055 --> 00:51:26.733
LIM SALT

579
00:51:28.811 --> 00:51:32.008
Sorry, but walk 100 meters
from him can I?

580
00:51:32.088 --> 00:51:33.487
What else!

581
00:51:34.006 --> 00:51:35.884
Don't chat, sign.

582
00:51:36.084 --> 00:51:41.239
By the way, that day the victim was preparing
for the concert, and you interrupted him.

583
00:51:41.359 --> 00:51:45.035
- If it was intentional, you will be punished.
- Wait, wait.

584
00:51:45.115 --> 00:51:46.753
Are you preparing for the concert?

585
00:51:47.792 --> 00:51:50.110
The concert should have already passed.

586
00:51:57.742 --> 00:52:00.779
ECLIPSE CONCERT

587
00:52:01.938 --> 00:52:03.297
Have you moved it?

588
00:52:16.923 --> 00:52:19.321
Sorry! Sorry, sorry, sorry!

589
00:52:19.401 --> 00:52:23.037
I'm a film studio employee
We're making a movie with Ryu Sung Jae.

590
00:52:23.117 --> 00:52:26.194
I need to meet him urgently.

591
00:52:26.274 --> 00:52:28.472
Could you please let me through?

592
00:52:28.551 --> 00:52:29.710
Do you have a ticket?

593
00:52:30.310 --> 00:52:31.988
No, there is no ticket.

594
00:52:32.068 --> 00:52:34.146
I can't miss it without a ticket.

595
00:52:41.499 --> 00:52:43.257
What? Where?

596
00:52:43.337 --> 00:52:46.374
You see, I'm Sun Jae's friend.

597
00:52:46.693 --> 00:52:50.250
I wanted to apologize personally
and make sure of something.

598
00:52:50.370 --> 00:52:52.607
Could you take me to him?

599
00:52:52.687 --> 00:52:55.245
Have you signed a restraining order?

600
00:52:55.325 --> 00:52:57.962
Signed! Yes, sure. But...

601
00:52:58.402 --> 00:53:01.638
Well, you yourself understand
It's better to apologize in person.

602
00:53:01.718 --> 00:53:03.996
I want to look at Sun Jae.

603
00:53:04.076 --> 00:53:05.754
Look on TV.

604
00:53:05.874 --> 00:53:08.352
Keep your distance from him
100 meters,

605
00:53:08.432 --> 00:53:10.390
as written in the order, please!

606
00:53:10.470 --> 00:53:13.746
Then can we talk at a distance?

607
00:53:14.066 --> 00:53:15.504
Well please!

608
00:53:15.584 --> 00:53:18.941
Hello? A-...Hello? Hello? I can't hear you!

609
00:53:19.381 --> 00:53:20.939
A-... A-... Hello?

610
00:53:23.297 --> 00:53:24.575
What should I do?

611
00:53:26.254 --> 00:53:28.492
Wow. Song Jae!

612
00:53:28.891 --> 00:53:30.370
She came again.

613
00:53:30.450 --> 00:53:33.566
Says you are friends
that he wants to meet.

614
00:53:33.726 --> 00:53:35.125
Should I let her in here?

615
00:53:35.205 --> 00:53:38.082
What will she say when she sees you?

616
00:53:38.162 --> 00:53:39.162
Are you out of your mind?

617
00:53:39.800 --> 00:53:41.279
Give it to her word for word.

618
00:53:41.359 --> 00:53:44.635
He will write a statement tomorrow,
just know that. Clear?

619
00:53:44.715 --> 00:53:45.715
Wait!

620
00:53:46.633 --> 00:53:49.151
At least tell him my name.

621
00:53:49.990 --> 00:53:51.029
Here.

622
00:53:51.429 --> 00:53:53.107
Lim Sol. This is my name.

623
00:53:53.187 --> 00:53:55.425
As soon as he hears it,
will understand everything immediately.

624
00:53:55.504 --> 00:53:56.703
So I ask you.

625
00:53:56.983 --> 00:53:59.061
Do you believe me? Yes?

626
00:53:59.141 --> 00:54:02.178
Yes, yes, of course, I believe
so go home

627
00:54:02.258 --> 00:54:04.096
and wait for a call from the station!

628
00:54:05.015 --> 00:54:07.972
Well, stand! I asked you!

629
00:54:15.804 --> 00:54:16.804
Song Jae!

630
00:54:17.802 --> 00:54:19.081
Ryu Sung Jae!

631
00:54:20.759 --> 00:54:23.317
Crap. He's already on stage.

632
00:54:25.035 --> 00:54:27.712
What day is it? OK.

633
00:54:51.568 --> 00:54:53.287
The concert has begun.

634
00:56:08.691 --> 00:56:09.850
Wow!

635
00:56:10.689 --> 00:56:15.085
Dear viewers, please
don't forget personal things

636
00:56:15.165 --> 00:56:17.882
- ...in the concert hall.
- What?

637
00:56:17.962 --> 00:56:21.718
- They didn’t report snow.
- Thank you for your attention.

638
00:56:22.957 --> 00:56:24.356
First snow.

639
00:56:25.275 --> 00:56:26.953
Sun Jae will be happy.

640
00:56:47.732 --> 00:56:49.970
Everything is the same as that day!

641
00:56:50.130 --> 00:56:51.130
Really...

642
00:56:51.648 --> 00:56:54.246
No! No.

643
00:57:11.189 --> 00:57:13.307
- All. Thank you.
- Thank you.

644
00:57:44.835 --> 00:57:46.553
Don't come, Sung Jae!

645
00:57:50.350 --> 00:57:51.350
You are the last...

646
00:57:52.028 --> 00:57:54.066
who did he see yesterday...

647
00:57:54.505 --> 00:57:56.064
before death.

648
00:57:56.783 --> 00:57:59.261
Please don't come.

649
00:58:14.845 --> 00:58:17.163
Too much time has passed.

650
00:58:18.442 --> 00:58:19.720
He won't come?

651
00:58:20.639 --> 00:58:22.078
That's great.

652
00:58:32.587 --> 00:58:33.587
Hello?

653
00:58:37.702 --> 00:58:38.781
I'm listening to you.

654
00:58:39.021 --> 00:58:40.021
It's me.

655
00:59:06.154 --> 00:59:08.072
What should I do now?

656
00:59:41.958 --> 00:59:42.958
So many years.

657
00:59:46.993 --> 00:59:48.112
And it's true.

658
00:59:49.870 --> 00:59:50.870
Yes.

659
00:59:55.984 --> 00:59:57.463
Why are you standing here?

660
00:59:59.980 --> 01:00:01.019
The car broke down?

661
01:00:02.937 --> 01:00:03.937
No.

662
01:00:06.773 --> 01:00:08.212
I was waiting for you.

663
01:00:10.769 --> 01:00:12.727
How did you know that I was coming?

664
01:00:13.966 --> 01:00:15.405
I felt it.

665
01:00:15.724 --> 01:00:17.682
But it would be better if you didn't come.

666
01:00:18.402 --> 01:00:19.800
I might not have noticed you.

667
01:00:24.156 --> 01:00:25.156
You haven't changed.

668
01:00:29.191 --> 01:00:30.509
Well, shall we have some tea?

669
01:00:32.627 --> 01:00:33.627
It's probably too late.

670
01:00:35.824 --> 01:00:37.742
No! Everything is fine.

671
01:00:37.822 --> 01:00:38.981
Song Jae!

672
01:00:40.659 --> 01:00:43.057
I really don't want to disturb you,

673
01:00:43.217 --> 01:00:46.374
but at the after-party everyone had already searched you.

674
01:00:47.053 --> 01:00:49.530
No. We can't let him go!

675
01:00:50.410 --> 01:00:51.410
Just a minute.

676
01:00:51.848 --> 01:00:52.967
No, don't go!

677
01:00:55.644 --> 01:00:56.803
It is forbidden.

678
01:00:57.762 --> 01:00:58.762
What?

679
01:01:00.519 --> 01:01:03.077
You know, it's just... So...

680
01:01:03.157 --> 01:01:04.476
Sung Jae, huh?

681
01:01:04.955 --> 01:01:06.354
Let's be together!

682
01:01:07.153 --> 01:01:10.470
Tonight let's be together. Me and you!

683
01:01:39.920 --> 01:01:42.877
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

684
01:01:43.037 --> 01:01:46.553
She told him this:
"Tonight let's be together. Me and you."

685
01:01:46.633 --> 01:01:48.991
Where are we going?

686
01:01:49.311 --> 01:01:51.309
To a place where no one will disturb us.

687
01:01:51.389 --> 01:01:52.867
I won't be back today.

688
01:01:53.107 --> 01:01:54.825
I'll sleep here, mom.

689
01:01:55.704 --> 01:01:56.943
What is he doing?

690
01:01:57.263 --> 01:01:59.181
Let's say fate has changed.

691
01:01:59.421 --> 01:02:01.818
But will it really be better than before?

692
01:02:01.978 --> 01:02:05.894
If we met again
I would say that.

693
01:02:06.693 --> 01:02:08.492
I liked you too.

694
01:02:08.571 --> 01:02:09.810
This means...

695
01:02:10.170 --> 01:02:13.207
did you feel the same?

696
01:02:13.327 --> 01:02:14.327
Something...

697
01:02:14.885 --> 01:02:15.885
...changed?

698
01:02:16.244 --> 01:02:19.361
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

699
01:02:19.441 --> 01:02:21.958
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

